Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; The Afterglow pointer scheme: files in C:\ReactOS\Cursors\Afterglow (copy the output of gen-cursors.py there), listed as
; "Afterglow" in Control Panel, Mouse, Pointers. Static busy pointers are named here (the dialog shows no preview for .ani files);
; the animated afterglow-working.ani and afterglow-busy.ani ship next to them for Windows. ReactOS 0.4.16 itself does not load
; a pointer scheme; see patch-user32.py and docs/reactos-desktop-pointers.md.
;
